                <div class="rendering rendering_researchoutput  rendering_researchoutput_harvard rendering_contributiontojournal rendering_harvard rendering_contributiontojournal_harvard"><a rel="Person" href="https://forskning.ruc.dk/da/persons/riza/" class="link"><span>Taskale, AR</span></a> 2026, '<a rel="ContributionToJournal" href="https://forskning.ruc.dk/da/publications/manufacturing-the-leviathan-palantirs-technological-republic-and-/" class="link harvard_title"><span>Manufacturing the Leviathan: Palantir’s ‘Technological republic’ and the nationalist faction of the tech oligarchy</span></a>', <span><em>Science as Culture</em></span>, bind Latest articles. <a onclick="window.open(this.href, '_blank','noopener,noreferrer'); return false;" href="https://doi.org/10.1080/09505431.2025.2607360" class="link"><span>https://doi.org/10.1080/09505431.2025.2607360</span></a></div>
