                <div class="rendering rendering_researchoutput  rendering_researchoutput_standard rendering_contributiontojournal rendering_standard rendering_contributiontojournal_standard"><a rel="ContributionToJournal" href="https://forskning.ruc.dk/da/publications/manufacturing-the-leviathan-palantirs-technological-republic-and-/" class="link"><span><strong>Manufacturing the Leviathan: Palantir’s ‘Technological republic’ and the nationalist faction of the tech oligarchy.</strong></span></a> / <a rel="Person" href="https://forskning.ruc.dk/da/persons/riza/" class="link"><span>Taskale, Ali Riza</span></a>. <br />I: <span>Science as Culture</span>, Bind Latest articles, 2026.<p class="type"><span class="type_family">Publikation<span class="type_family_sep">: </span></span><span class="type_classification_parent">Bidrag til tidsskrift<span class="type_parent_sep"> › </span></span><span class="type_classification">Tidsskriftartikel</span><span class="type_classification"><span class="type_parent_sep"> › </span>Forskning</span><span class="type_classification"><span class="type_parent_sep"> › </span>peer review</span></p></div>
